						<code profiles="default">set_cmp GD_Shields.Projectiles.Proj_LegendaryBoosterShield:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.Behavior_Explode_140 BehaviorSequences[0].BehaviorData2[7].Behavior.StatusEffectDamage.BaseValueScaleConstant 1.000000 .25</code>
