				<category name="Remove Non-Uniform Leveling in Coop">
					<comment>Irksome. If you play together you should all get same xp</comment>
					<comment>Small xp penalty in solo, because you have the ability to conveinently farm fast and the game is easier</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Globals.General.Globals ExpAwardWeights ((Players=1,KillerExpBonus=0.000000,ExpWeight=0.900000),(Players=2,KillerExpBonus=0.000000,ExpWeight=1.000000),(Players=3,KillerExpBonus=0.000000,ExpWeight=1.000000),(Players=4,KillerExpBonus=0.000000,ExpWeight=1.000000))</code>
				</category>
