				</category>
				<category name="Global Stat Scaling">
					<comment>Base enemy health has been increased by slightly more than 2x. It's not as bad as it sounds.</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>Money pickup value has been increased from 1.25 to 1.75</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_UniversalAdditionalEnemyDamagePerLvl:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.01950000</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_UniversalAdditionalEnemyHealthPerLvl:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.020000</code>
					<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_SlamMomentum:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 50000.000000</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_BaseEnemyHealth:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 150.00000</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.AIParameters.Attribute_HealthMultiplier:AIParameterValueResolver_1 DefaultValue (BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Economy.CashPickups.Att_CashPickups_BaseValue:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 2.0000</code>
					</hotfix>
				</category>
				<category name="Enemy Attribute Changes">
					<comment>Many of these changes are HP reductions to offset the global increase in enemy HP.</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>A few particularly weak bosses had their Health or Shields increased, and several bosses had the ratio of HP to Shields modified.</comment>
					<category name="Standard Enemies">
						<category name="Scavs">
