				</category>
				<category name="BL3-ified FFYL- Credit to Ostrix, Read Text Inside">
					<hotfix name="Hotfix" package="Quince_Doppel_Streaming">
						<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel.InputContexts.InputContext_DoppelInjured_Potential InputSets (InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_Injured',InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_QuickSelect',InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_AlwaysAvailable',InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_WeaponActions')</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Input.Contexts.InputContext_Injured InputActions (InputActionDefinition'GD_Input.Actions.InputAction_ActionSkill')</code>
					</hotfix>
					<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.Anims.Player_ReRez bBlocksWeaponActions False</code>
					</hotfix>
					<comment>In pretty much every unreleased iteration of this mod, I included a chunk of code from Ostrix's Better FFYL mod. </comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>I was granted permission to use it from PawnM0v3, who themselves received permission to use it for Azurelands.</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>HOWEVER, all separate versions of Better FFYL have since been deleted, and it's proven extremely difficult to find/contact them to be able to ask directly.</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>Therefore, the only FFYL changes in the release version of this are the ones I personally found or heavily modified, </comment>
					<comment>notably the Jack changes that allow ADS with Potential (which would have otherwise *removed* ADS in FFYL for whatever reason.</comment>
					<comment>    </comment>
					<comment>If anyone objects to this middle ground, then I will remove all components of it from active releases, but I hope it's okay as is.</comment>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.injured.PlayerInjuredDefinition InjuredMovementSpeed 350.000000</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Globals.General.Globals InjuredDeadDelayBetweenDeathAnimAndDigistruct 0.400000</code>
					<category name="FFYL Visual Darkening / Head Bob Removal">
						<hotfix name="Hotfix" level="None">
							<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.injured.PlayerInjuredDefinition InjuredScreenFadePartSys ParticleSystem'FX_INT_Screen.Particles.Part_DownState_Screen'</code>
						</hotfix>
						<code profiles="default">set FX_INT_Screen.Particles.Part_DownState_Screen:ParticleSpriteEmitter_63 LODLevels ( )</code>
					</category>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_PlayerShared.injured.PlayerInjuredDefinition InjuredViewDropStrength 0.000000</code>
					<code profiles="default">set GD_Input.Contexts.InputContext_Injured InputSets (InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_Injured',InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_QuickSelect',InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_AlwaysAvailable',InputSetDefinition'GD_Input.Sets.InputSet_WeaponActions')</code>
				</category>
				<category name="Slam Damage Change: Credit to ZetaDaemon">
					<comment>Slams now receive bonuses to Rocket Damage (and consequently, Damage Dealt) AND Don't mess up Trouble With Space Hurps. Have your cake and eat it too!</comment>
					<hotfix name="Nisha" level="None">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Init_PlayerSlamDamage ValueFormula (bEnabled=True,Level=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=AttributeDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Att_UniversalBalanceScaler',InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Power=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Inventory.MoonItemItemLevel',InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Offset=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),Multiplier=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageSourceModifiers.InstigatedRocketDamageModifier',InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=0.000050))</code>
					</hotfix>
				</category>
			</category>
			<category name="Presentations ">
				<comment>This section holds a large portion of general and Class Mod-specific stat presentations, used and (currently) unused.</comment>
				<comment></comment>
				<comment>Guns, Grenades, and Oz Kits have many of their specific presentations in their own sections.</comment>
				<category name="Presentation Megadump">
					<category name="Miscellaneous Decimal Changes ">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Health.AttrPresent_HealthMaxValue RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Health.AttrPresent_HealthMaxValue bDisplayPercentAsFloat True</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Health.AttrPresent_HealthMaxValue FloatPrecision 1</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedAllStatusChanceModifier RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedAllStatusChanceModifier bDisplayPercentAsFloat True</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedAllStatusChanceModifier FloatPrecision 1</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.CriticalHits.AttrPresent_PlayerCriticalHitBonus RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.CriticalHits.AttrPresent_PlayerCriticalHitBonus bDisplayPercentAsFloat True</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.CriticalHits.AttrPresent_PlayerCriticalHitBonus FloatPrecision 1</code>
					</category>
					<category name="Status Effect Consistency">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Weapons.AttrPresent_WeaponStatusEffectDamage Description Status Effect Damage</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Weapons.AttrPresent_WeaponStatusEffectChanceModifier Description Gun Status Effect Chance</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Moxxtail.AttrPresent_Moxxtail_ElementalChance Description Status Effect Chance</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_ReceivedStatusEffectDamageModifier Description Status Effect Damage Resistance</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedStatusEffectDamageModifier Description Status Effect Damage</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedAllStatusChanceModifier Description Status Effect Chance</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_InstigatedStatusEffectDamageModifier Description Status Effect Damage</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_InstigatedAllTypesStatusChanceModifier Description Status Effect Chance</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Petunia_AttributePres.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_AllTypesStatusDamage Description Status Effect Damage</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedStatusEffectDamageModifier bDontDisplayNumber True</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedAllStatusChanceModifier Icon elementalresistance</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.Damage.AttrPresent_InstigatedStatusEffectDamageModifier Icon elementalresistance</code>
					</category>
					<category name="Class Mod Decimal Changes + Element Colors ">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_AccuracyMaxValue RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_AccuracyMaxValue bDisplayPercentAsFloat True</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_AccuracyMaxValue FloatPrecision 1</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_AttributePresentation.ClassMods_Only.AttrPresent_ClassMod_ActiveSkillCooldownConsumptionRate RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
