				<category name="Presentation Adoption Center">
					<comment>A big part of this mod is cleaning up item presentations to be clearer and less redundant:</comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>In changing descriptions and other text blurbs up, I ended up with a LOT of spare presentations that have not found a home. </comment>
					<comment></comment>
					<comment>I kept them here for future reference, whether for official revisions or anyone experimenting with their own version at home.</comment>
					<category name="Just In Case You Thought This Mod Didn't Have Enough Text ">
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Cork_Weap_SniperRifles.Barrel.SR_Barrel_Vladof_Longnail:AttributePresentationDefinition_8 NoConstraintText <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Fires Kinetic bullets that pierce most enemy Shields. Fixed parts and reduced base damage.</font></font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Shields.A_Item.Shield_Spike_Shock:AttributePresentationDefinition_6 Description Chance to [shock]Electrocute[-shock] enemies.</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_SniperRifles.A_Weapons.WeaponType_Hyperion_Sniper:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 NoConstraintText <font size="14">[projectilecount]Hyperion Luxury:[-projectilecount] Reverse recoil causes sustained fire to gradually improve [skill]Accuracy[-skill], up to a maximum.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Cork_Weap_Lasers.A_Weapons.WT_Hyperion_Laser:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 NoConstraintText <font size="14">[projectilecount]Hyperion Luxury:[-projectilecount] Reverse recoil causes sustained fire to gradually improve [skill]Accuracy[-skill], up to a maximum.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 Description </code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_GrenadeMods.Payload.Payload_BouncingBetty_AirMask:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 Description Fires a blistering [skill]shower of bullets[-skill] around a [skill]bouncing projectile[-skill].</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_GrenadeMods.Payload.Payload_BouncingBetty_AirMask:AttributePresentationDefinition_4 Description [skill]Shatters[-skill] enemy air masks. Deals [skill]50 O[small]2[-small] damage[-skill] to opponents in [skill]duels[-skill].</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_MoonItems.Body.Body_AntiAir_PerdyLights:AttributePresentationDefinition_3 Description Increases [skill]Melee Override Cooldown Rate[-skill].</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Shields.A_Item.Shield_Booster_MoxxisSlammer:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 Description <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Slammer Boosters increase your Movement Speed, Fire Rate, and Reload Speed by 30% for 5 seconds when picked up.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Cork_ClassMods_SMJ.A_Item_Gladiator.ClassMod_Gladiator_Protector:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Slammer Boosters increase your Movement Speed, Fire Rate, and Reload Speed by 30% for 5 seconds when picked up.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_GrenadeMods.Payload.Payload_Singularity_AirMask:AttributePresentationDefinition_4 Description Increases [skill]Melee Override Cooldown Rate[-skill].</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 BasePriority 18.00</code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 NoConstraintText <font size="13">Instead of [skill]Kinetic Damage[-skill], this Gun deals [explosive]Explosive Damage[-explosive], and will deal at least a portion of its damage in a radius unless stated otherwise.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Cork_ClassMods_TW.A_Item_Prototype.ClassMod_Prototype_Overclocker:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Slammer Boosters increase your Movement Speed, Fire Rate, and Reload Speed by 30% for 5 seconds when picked up.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Cork_ClassMods_SMJ.A_Item_Enforcer.ClassMod_Enforcer_Fighter:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Slammer Boosters increase your Movement Speed, Fire Rate, and Reload Speed by 30% for 5 seconds when picked up.</font></code>
					</category>
				</category>
			</category>
