						<category name="Error Code Passive Stats ">
							<comment>Originally, Glitch weapons received an intrinsic 1.35x Magazine Size scalar AND 2 shots added to the Magazine Size, which brought a few weapon types wildly out of band. </comment>
							<comment>Now, all Glitch Rarity weapons receive a 1.35x Reload Speed scalar to make fishing for Error Codes faster while requiring more gear/skill investment for per-mag Error Code uptime.</comment>
