								<code profiles="default">set GD_Cork_Shields.A_Item.Shield_Spike_Ice:AttributePresentationDefinition_5 Description <font size="14"><font color="#9f99ff">Maliwan Rebuttal:</font> Upon taking [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], send out a <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> [skill]Spike[-skill] to the attacker.<br>[funstat][skill]Spikes[-skill] deal [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] and have a high chance to <font color="#5ff5ff">Freeze</font> non-immune enemies. This [skill]Status Effect[-skill] deals [corrosive]20%[-corrosive] of [skill]Spike Damage[-skill] per tick.</font></code>
