							<code profiles="default">set GD_MoonItems.Body.Body_Hyperventilator:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="14"><font color="#9f99ff">Tediore Liquidation:</font> Increases [skill]Fire Rate[-skill] and [skill]Movement Speed[-skill] for each unit of [skill]O[small]2[-small][-skill] missing.<br>[funstat][skill]Slamming[-skill] after falling a sufficient distance will deal [skill]Rocket Damage[-skill] in an area, staggering [skill]non-Boss enemies[-skill].</font></code>
