							<code profiles="default">set GD_MoonItems.Body.Body_Juggernaut:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="14"><font color="#9f99ff">Torgue Girth:</font> Increased [skill]Slam Damage[-skill], and grants [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill] to randomly rolled [skill]Elements[-skill].</code>
							<code profiles="default">set GD_MoonItems.Body.Body_Juggernaut:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 Description <font size="14">[skill]Slam[-skill] damage [skill]Shatters[-skill] enemy air masks.<br>[funstat][skill]Slamming[-skill] after falling a sufficient distance will deal [skill]Rocket Damage[-skill] in an area, staggering [skill]non-Boss enemies[-skill].</font></code>
							<category name="Resistance Crunching ">
								<comment>Juggernaut Oz Kits have had their resistance parts crunched so that you will never roll the same Element twice, and therefore will never roll a 'dud' resistance. </comment>
								<comment>While this means that the total number of combinations is lower, there aren't *objectively* inferior rolls anymore.</comment>
								<category name="Common">
									<code profiles="default">set GD_MoonItems.PartLists.Parts_Juggernaut_01_Common BetaPartData (bEnabled=True,WeightedParts=((bDisabled=False,Part=ArtifactPartDefinition'GD_MoonItems.Enable2nd.EnableSecond_Effect2',Manufacturers=,MinGameStageIndex=0,MaxGameStageIndex=1,DefaultWeightIndex=0),(bDisabled=False,Part=ArtifactPartDefinition'GD_MoonItems.Enable2nd.EnableSecond_Effect3',Manufacturers=,MinGameStageIndex=0,MaxGameStageIndex=1,DefaultWeightIndex=0),))</code>
