						<code profiles="default">set GD_Shields.A_Item.Shield_Roid_Avalanche:AttributePresentationDefinition_4 Description <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Combines the effects of a Cryo Spike and Cryo Nova Shield, dealing Melee and Status Effect Damage, respectively.</font></font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_Shields.A_Item.Shield_Roid_Avalanche:AttributePresentationDefinition_3 Description <font size="14"><font color="#9f99ff">Pangolin? Rebuke:</font> Releases a [skill]Nova[-skill] when depleted, dealing <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> [skill]Status Effect Damage[-skill] in a radius.<br>[funstat]Must fully recharge between [skill]Novas[-skill].<br>[funstat]<font color="#9f99ff">Pangolin?? Rebuttal:</font> Upon taking [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], send out a <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> [skill]Spike[-skill] to the attacker.<br>[funstat][skill]Spikes[-skill] deal [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] and have a high chance to <font color="#5ff5ff">Freeze</font> non-immune enemies.</font></code>
						<code profiles="default">set GD_ItemGrades.Shields.ItemGrade_Gear_Shield_Roid_Avalanche Manufacturers ((Manufacturer=ManufacturerDefinition'GD_Manufacturers.Manufacturers.Pangolin',Grades=((GradeModifiers=(ExpLevel=1,CustomInventoryDefinition=None),GameStageRequirement=(MinGameStage=1,MaxGameStage=100),MinSpawnProbabilityModifier=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),MaxSpawnProbabilityModifier=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)))))</code>
