						<code profiles="default">set GD_MoonItems.Body.Body_Springs:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="14"><font color="#ffb400">Oz kits let you breathe in the vacuum of space... as long as your O[small]2[-small] Capacity is not depleted.<br>[funstat]Pressing the jump key again after jumping lets you perform a boost jump at the cost of 10 O[small]2[-small].<br>[funstat]Additionally, Slamming after falling a sufficient distance will deal Rocket Damage in an area, staggering non-Boss enemies.</font></font></code>
