							<code profiles="default">set GD_Gladiator_Skills.ActionSkill.Skill_Gladiator SkillDescription [skill]Action Skill[-skill]. Press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> to raise your [skill]Aspis[-skill] and absorb all direct frontal damage. The [skill]Aspis[-skill] can store a finite amount of absorbed damage as energy, indicated by the sound and visuals of the [skill]Aspis[-skill] ramping up, which exponentially increases its damage when thrown.<br>The [skill]Aspis[-skill] is automatically thrown at the end of the active duration, or if you press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> again while it is active, dealing [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Status Effect Damage[-skill] in a small radius before returning to you.</code>
