								<code profiles="default">set GD_Gladiator_Skills.Xiphos.BladeSurge SkillDescription [skill]Melee Override Skill[-skill]. Press <StringAliasMap:Action.Melee> to quickly [skill]dash[-skill] toward an enemy with your [skill]Xiphos[-skill] blade readied, gaining [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill] mid-flight.<br>This attack deals [shock]Shock[-shock] [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] and always applies a [shock]Shock[-shock] [skill]Status Effect[-skill]. The [skill]Blood Rush[-skill] only goes on cooldown if it hits a target that is already [skill][health]Bleeding[-health][-skill] or if it misses.<br>Additionally, you deal increased [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] regardless of cooldown status.</code>
