							<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.ActionSkill.Skill_Showdown SkillDescription [skill]Action Skill[-skill]. Press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> to activate [skill]Showdown[-skill], causing you to [skill]automatically aim[-skill] at enemies and gain boosts to Gun stats as well as [skill]Melee Damage[-skill]. Holding <StringAliasMap:Action.Aim> and flicking <StringAliasMap:Action.Look> in a direction allows you to quickly switch targets. [skill]Rocket Launchers[-skill] are excluded from the [skill]Gun Damage[-skill] bonus.</code>
