						<category name="Order">
							<hotfix name="Nisha" package="GD_Lawbringer_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Order SkillDescription <font size="15">Every time you take [corrosive]15%[-corrosive] of your [skill]Max Health[-skill] in total damage from enemies, you gain a stack of [skill]Order[-skill]. You have a chance to [skill]instantly heal [useful]double[-useful] the last instance of damage taken[-skill] and gain a chance to [skill]automatically score Critical Hits with all damage you deal[-skill] based on the number of [skill]Order[-skill] you currently have. [skill]Order[-skill] stacks are immediately lost after [corrosive]10[-corrosive] seconds without taking or dealing damage.<br>[skill]Automatic Critical Hits[-skill] can be identified by special [slag]purple[-slag] [skill]Critical Hit[-skill] text.</font></code>
