								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.NoPainNoGain SkillDescription Your [skill]Max Health[-skill] is reduced. However, you gain increased [skill]Action Skill Cooldown Rate[-skill] and [skill]Melee Override Cooldown Rate[-skill], with the latter gaining an additional bonus per [skill]Order Stack[-skill], as well as [skill]FFYL Duration[-skill] and [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill] per [skill]Order Stack[-skill].</code>
