						<category name="Blood of The Guilty">
							<hotfix name="Nisha" package="GD_Lawbringer_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.BloodOfTheGuilty SkillDescription When you or an ally [skill]kills an enemy[-skill], you gain a stack of [skill]Order[-skill] and restore a portion of your [skill]Max Health[-skill] over [corrosive]1[-corrosive] second.<br>This skill also raises your [skill]Order Stack Cap[-skill] by [corrosive]5[-corrosive].</code>
