						<category name="Wanted ">
							<hotfix name="Nisha" package="GD_Lawbringer_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Wanted:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_CauseDamage_390 DamageFormula.BaseValueScaleConstant 0.40</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Wanted SkillDescription When an enemy would cause you to gain an [skill]Order[-skill] stack, they gain a [skill]Wanted[-skill] stack, signified by a big ol' [explosive]gold[-explosive] star. Damaging that target consumes all [skill]Wanted[-skill] stacks and deals [skill]Kinetic Melee Damage[-skill] based on the number of stacks consumed.<br>The maximum number of [skill]Wanted[-skill] stacks that an enemy can have [corrosive]5[-corrosive], and enemies still gain [skill]Wanted[-skill] stacks even if you are at your maximum [skill]Order[-skill] stacks.<br>Additionally, you deal increased [skill]Melee Damage[-skill].</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Wanted SkillEffectPresentations (AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Wanted:AttributePresentationDefinition_0',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.SaddleUp:AttributePresentationDefinition_6')</code>
