						<category name="The Third Degree">
							<hotfix name="Nisha" package="GD_Lawbringer_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.TheThirdDegree SkillDescription When [skill]Showdown[-skill] ends or upon killing an enemy, you gain one stack of [skill]Third Degree[-skill], up to [corrosive]3[-skill]. [skill]Third Degree[-skill] stacks grant increased [skill]Movement Speed[-skill] and [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] until you next deal [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], after which all stacks are lost.</code>
