								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.ShortFused SkillIconTextureName SkillIcon-Short-Fused</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.ShortFused SkillDescription [skill]Kill Skill[-skill]. After killing an enemy, all sources of [skill]Bullet, Rocket, and Melee Damage[-skill] gain an [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Grenade Damage Bonus Element[-skill] for [corrosive]10[-corrosive] seconds.<br>This [skill]Bonus Element[-skill] is based on the [skill]Body Shot Damage[-skill] of your [skill]equipped Gun[-skill], and [skill]deals more damage the closer you are to enemies[-skill], only reaching its maximum bonus when you're REALLY close. Get up close and personal!</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.ShortFused SkillType SKILL_TYPE_Kill</code>
