								<code profiles="default">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.BonaFideGrit SkillDescription [skill]Kill Skill[-skill]. Killing an enemy grants you [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] and increased [skill]Critical Hit Damage[-skill] for [corrosive]10[-corrosive] seconds.</code>
