						<category name="Hot Lead / Silver Bullet" MUT="true">
							<category name="Hot Lead Status Effects ">
								<hotfix name="Nisha" package="GD_Lawbringer_Streaming">
									<code profiles="">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.HotLead SkillDescription Your [skill]Critical Hits[-skill] gain an [incendiary]Incendiary[-incendiary][skill] Bullet Damage Bonus Element[-skill] and now apply guaranteed, [skill]stackable[-skill] [skill][incendiary]Incendiary[-incendiary] Status Effects[-skill] to enemies.<br>The [skill]Bonus Element[-skill] and [skill]Status Effect Damage[-skill] are based on the [skill]Body Shot Damage[-skill] of the damage source, and deal more damage the lower the base [skill]Critical Hit Multiplier[-skill] of the attack that caused it.</code>
									<code profiles="">set GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.HotLead:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description Ignite Damage: Rank $NUMBER$</code>
