								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.HyperionPunch SkillDescription <font size="15">[skill]Melee Override[-skill]. Dealing [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Damage[-skill] grants you stacks of [skill]Hyperion Punch[-skill]; at max stacks, pressing <StringAliasMap:Action.Melee> launches a homing fist that deals [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Melee Damage[-skill]. This consumes all stacks of [skill]Hyperion Punch[-skill], and while hits with it can grant stacks, there is a roughly [corrosive]5[-corrosive] second delay before a [skill]Hyperion Punch[-skill] can be thrown again. This delay is unaffected by [skill]Melee Override Cooldown Rate[-skill] bonuses.<br>Additionally, deal increased [skill]Melee Damage[-skill].</font></code>
