							<hotfix name="AddSkills" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesUp_Active TrackedSkillType TRACKEDSKILL_Untracked</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesUp_Active bSubjectToGradeRules True</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesUp_Active SkillDescription Gain increased [skill]Reload Speed[-skill] and [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill] for each individual shot in your equipped Gun's [skill]Maximum Magazine Size[-skill]. This skill is unaffected by ammo [skill]currently[-skill] in your equipped Gun's [skill]Magazine[-skill], and [useful]reverses[-useful] its calculation for guns that [skill]overflow their Magazines[-skill]. Nice try, guys!</code>
