						<category name="Kick Him While He's Up / Fool's Errand">
							<hotfix name="Claptrap" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesUp SkillDescription You deal increased [skill]Gun Damage[-skill], [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill], and [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], but your [skill]Shield Recharge Delay[-skill] is lengthened.<br><br>[useful]"This is the worst day of my life."<br>"The worst day of your life SO FAR."[-useful]</code>
