							<hotfix name="AddSkills" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown SkillDescription You gain increased [skill]Fight For Your Life Duration[-skill] and now recover all of your [skill]Max Health[-skill] upon [skill]Second Wind[-skill].<br>Also, unlocks <font color="#ff6600">ACTION PACKAGE</font> [skill]Clap-in-the-Box[-skill].</code>
