								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell SkillDescription <font size="15">Gain increased [skill]Fire Rate[-skill], [skill]Reload Speed[-skill], passive [skill]Ammo Regeneration[-skill] for all types except [skill]Rocket Launchers[-skill], and increased [skill]Fight For Your Life Duration[-skill].</font>. While you are in [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill], the [skill]Fire Rate[-skill] and [skill]Reload Speed[-skill] are [skill]shared with allies[-skill] and [useful]doubled for you[-useful], and you gain greatly increased [skill]Movement Speed[-skill] in [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill].</font></code>
