								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.ThroughThickAndThin SkillDescription Increases your [skill]Action Skill Cooldown Rate[-skill] and [skill]Damage Dealt[-skill]. While [skill]VaultHunter.EXE[-skill] is active, these bonuses are [skill]shared with any allies[-skill] and you gain a further bonus to [skill]Grenade, Melee[-skill] and [skill]Status Effect Damage[-skill].</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.ThroughThickAndThin:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description Action Skill Cooldown Rate: $NUMBER$</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.ElementOfSurprise:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 Description Damage Dealt: $NUMBER$<br>Additional Grenade, Melee, and Status Effect Damage: $NUMBER$</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.ElementOfSurprise:AttributePresentationDefinition_2 Attribute AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageSourceModifiers.InstigatedMeleeDamageModifier'</code>
							</hotfix>
						</category>
						<category name="High Fives, Guys!">
							<hotfix name="Claptrap" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description <font size="15">Regenerates $NUMBER$ of your Max Health / sec.</font></code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 FloatPrecision 1</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 bDisplayPercentAsFloat True</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 Description <font size="15">Gun Damage: $NUMBER$<br>Fire Rate: $NUMBER$<br>Magazine Size: $NUMBER$</font></code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 RoundingMode ATTRROUNDING_Float</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 FloatPrecision 1</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 bDisplayPercentAsFloat True</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_6 Description <font size="15">Duration/Cooldown: $NUMBER$ seconds</font></code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys SkillDescription <font size="15">Gain passive [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] as well as increased [skill]Gun Damage[-skill], [skill]Fire Rate[-skill], and [skill]Magazine Size[-skill].<br>Hold <StringAliasMap:Action.Melee> to request a [skill]High Five[-skill] from friends and enemies alike; if you're left hanging for [corrosive]5[-corrosive] seconds, these bonuses are [useful]doubled[-useful] for [corrosive]20[-corrosive] seconds. If an enemy or ally [skill]Melees[-skill] your hand during that window, the bonuses are [useful]tripled[-useful] for [corrosive]20[-corrosive] seconds.<br>You cannot request another [skill]High Five[-skill] until either effect has expired.</font></code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.ILoveYouGuys.Att_HighFiveGuys_WeaponDamage:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0 ConstantValue 0.12500000</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.ILoveYouGuys.Att_HighFiveGuys_FireRate:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_3 ConstantValue -0.12500000</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.ILoveYouGuys.Att_HighFiveGuys_RegenAmount:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_2 ConstantValue 0.0150000</code>
