									<code profiles="">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.SafetyFirst SkillDescription <font size="15">[skill]Defensive Subroutines.[-skill] You randomly pick a [skill]Health[-skill] or [skill]Shields[-skill] [skill]Subroutine[-skill], which grants increased [skill]Capacity[-skill] and passive [skill]Regeneration[-skill] for the chosen attribute. The catch? You deal [useful]reduced Gun Damage[-useful] with all types.<br>Upon selecting a [skill]Subroutine[-skill] you gain 100 [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill], which decay over time. When you run out of [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill], your [skill]Subroutine[-skill] will be replaced with a new one.</font></code>
