									<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.SafetyFirst SkillDescription <font size="15">[skill]Health Subroutine.[-skill] If you do not have any other [skill]Subroutines[-skill] available, automatically activate a [skill]Health[-skill] [skill]Subroutine[-skill], which grants increased [skill]Max Health[-skill] and passive [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] at the cost of reducing your [skill]Gun Damage[-skill] with all types.<br>Upon selecting a [skill]Subroutine[-skill] you gain [corrosive]100[-corrosive] [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill], which decay over time. When [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill] hit [corrosive]0[-corrosive], your [skill]Subroutine[-skill] will be replaced with a new one, which will be a non-[skill]Health Subroutine[-skill] if you have any other [skill]Subroutines[-skill] available.</font></code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields SkillName Subroutine - Health</code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields SkillIconTextureName Subroutine-Defensive-Health</code>
