							<hotfix name="Claptrap" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.RainbowCoolant:AttributePresentationDefinition_4 Description Elemental Damage: $NUMBER$<br><br><font color="#ff6600">Laser Inferno:</font> Refract [corrosive]Corrosive[-corrosive], [incendiary]Fire[-incendiary], and [shock]Shock[-shock] lasers from a fancy disco ball towards close-range enemies.</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.RainbowCoolant SkillDescription Deal additional [skill]Elemental Damage[-skill], and whenever you initiate a new [skill]Subroutine[-skill] you emit a massive <font color="#ff4040">R</font><font color="#ff7f66">a</font><font color="#ffee28">i</font><font color="#00ffaa">n</font><font color="#2185c5">b</font><font color="#236688">o</font><font color="#d5b8f2">w</font> [skill]Nova[-skill], which deals damage and applies [skill]Status Effects[-skill] of all Elements.<br>Also, unlocks <font color="#ff6600">ACTION PACKAGE</font> [skill]Laser Inferno[-skill].</code>
