								<category name="Defensive ">
									<hotfix name="Claptrap" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
										<code profiles="">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.Tripleclocked SkillDescription Multiplies the [skill]bonuses[-skill] and [useful]penalties[-useful] of the current [skill]Subroutine[-skill] by up to [skill]three[-skill] based on how few [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill] you currently have. [skill]Defensive Subroutines[-skill] always receive [skill][useful]tripled[-useful] Capacity[-skill], regardless of stacks, and [skill]Ammo Regeneration[-skill] values are unaffected..<br>Also, unlocks <font color="#ff6600">ACTION PACKAGE</font> [skill]One Shot Wonder[-skill].</code>
									</hotfix>
								</category>
								<category name="Health Only">
									<hotfix name="Claptrap" package="GD_Prototype_Streaming">
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.Tripleclocked SkillDescription Multiplies the [skill]bonuses[-skill] and [useful]penalties[-useful] of the current [skill]Subroutine[-skill] by up to [skill]three[-skill] based on how few [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill] you currently have. The [skill]Health Subroutines[-skill] always provides [skill][useful]tripled[-useful] Max Health[-skill], regardless of stacks, and [skill]Ammo Regeneration[-skill] values are unaffected..<br>Also, unlocks <font color="#ff6600">ACTION PACKAGE</font> [skill]One Shot Wonder[-skill].</code>
									</hotfix>
								</category>
							</category>
						</category>
					</category>
