							<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.ActionSkill.Skill_AirPower SkillDescription <font size="14">[skill]Action Skill[-skill]. Press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> to summon [skill]Wolf[-skill] and [skill]Saint[-skill], your trusty combat [skill]Surveyors[-skill]. [skill]Wolf[-skill] will roam and attack enemies, dealing [skill]Kinetic Damage[-skill] that can only be increased through certain skills, while [skill]Saint[-skill] stays close to you and regenerate your [skill]Health[-skill]. [skill]Wolf[-skill] can be damaged by enemies, regnerating [corrosive]10x[-corrosive] the current [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] provided by [skill]Saint[-skill], while [skill]Saint[-skill] does not take damage.<br>Press and hold <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> to instantly recall them, ending the [skill]Action Skill[-skill] and refunding [skill]Cooldown[-skill] based on remaining [skill]Duration[-skill].</font></code>
