						<category name="Laser Guided ">
							<hotfix name="Wilhelm" package="GD_Enforcer_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.LaserGuided SkillDescription <font size="15">When you activate [skill]Air Superiority[-skill], or press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> while it is active, [skill]Saint[-skill] will [skill]Paint[-skill] the target under your reticle. [skill]Wolf[-skill] will focus on the currently [skill]Painted[-skill] target, which receives increased [skill]Damage[-skill] from all sources, increasing further for [skill]Status Effect Damage[-skill], [skill]Rocket Damage[-skill], and [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill].<br>Additionally, if a target is killed while [skill]Painted[-skill], [skill]Air Superiority's Duration[-skill] is partially restored.</font></code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.LaserGuided:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description Duration Restored: $NUMBER$ seconds per Painted enemy kill</code>
