								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.Dreadnought.HazmatContainmentSystems SkillDescription You deal increased [skill]Elemental Damage[-skill].<br>Additionally, whenever you are afflicted with an [skill][incendiary]Incendiary[-incendiary], [shock]Shock[-shock], or [corrosive]Corrosive[-corrosive] Status Effect[-skill], you and any allies gain [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill] to that Element and you can spread that [skill]Status Effect[-skill] to enemies by getting close enough.</code>
