								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar SkillDescription Gain increased [skill]Gun Status Effect Chance[-skill], with an additional bonus for [skill]Assault Rifles, SMGs, or Lasers[-skill].<br>Additionally, whenever you apply an [skill][incendiary]Incendiary[-incendiary][-skill], [skill][shock]Shock[-shock][-skill], or [skill][corrosive]Corrosive[-corrosive] Status Effect[-skill] to an enemy, there is a chance that a [skill]<font color="#5ff5ff">Freeze</font> Effect[-skill] will be applied as well.</code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar SkillEffectPresentations (AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar:AttributePresentationDefinition_0',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar:AttributePresentationDefinition_1')</code>
