								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder SkillDescription While [skill]Air Superiority[-skill] is active, you periodically gain stacks of [skill]Rolling Thunder[-skill], increasing [skill]Wolf's Bolt Damage[-skill]. Does not apply to [skill]Action Skill Augments[-skill] besides [skill]Venom Bolts[-skill].</code>
