						<category name="Omega Strike">
							<hotfix name="Wilhelm" package="GD_Enforcer_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.OmegaStrike SkillDescription <font size="15">[skill]Action Skill Augment[-skill]. While active, [skill]Wolf[-skill] will periodically launch [ice]Cryo[-ice] [skill]Missiles[-skill] that deal [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill] and apply a <font color="#5ff5ff">Deep Freeze</font> [skill]Effect[-skill] that immobilizes non-boss enemies in place but does not itself deal damage. Standard [ice]Freeze[-ice] [skill]Effects[-skill] can still be applied to targets affected by <font color="#5ff5ff">Deep Freeze</font>.<br><br>Additionally, you deal increased [skill]Elemental Damage[-skill] and gain passive [skill]Grenade Regeneration[-skill] regardless of whether or not [skill]Wolf[-skill] is deployed, both of which are [useful]doubled[-useful] while you are [skill]Airborne[-skill].</font></code>
								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.OmegaStrike:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 Description <font size="14">Passively regenerates a Grenade every $NUMBER$ seconds while grounded</font></code>
							</hotfix>
