								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.CyberCommando.VengeanceCannon SkillDescription <font size="15">[useful]Cyborg Augmentation:[-useful] Weapon<br>On [skill]Shield break[-skill], you automatically activate your shoulder-mounted [skill]Vengeance Cannon[-skill] and [skill]remove Gun Recoil[-skill] for a moderate duration. The [skill]Vengeance Cannon[-skill] receives most stat bonuses that apply to your Guns, and fires large, slow-moving projectiles that deal [skill][shock]Shock[-shock][-skill] [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill] in a [corrosive]400[-corrosive] unit radius in tandem with your equipped weapon. Your [skill]Shield[-skill] must [skill]fully recharge[-skill] between activations.<br><br>Additionally, your [skill]Shield Recharge Delay[-skill] is improved.</font></code>
