								<code profiles="default">set GD_Enforcer_Skills.Dreadnought.TerminationProtocols SkillDescription Replaces [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill] with [skill]Termination Protocols[-skill]. During [skill]Termination Protocols[-skill], you can walk at a reduced speed, fire your weapons, and you constantly [shock]Shock[-shock] nearby enemies. If the timer runs out, your power core goes critical, releasing a [skill]Nuclear Explosion[-skill] that deals massive [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Grenade Damage[-skill].<br>Additionally, you and [skill]Wolf[-skill] gain increased [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill] and [skill]Damage Dealt[-skill]</code>
