								<code profiles="default">set Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.ShortSummer SkillDescription Dealing <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo Damage</font> to an enemy while [skill]Cold as Ice[-skill] is active grants you a stack of [skill]Short Summer[-skill].<br>You gain increased [skill]Action Skill Cooldown Rate[-skill] and [skill]Shield Recharge Delay[-skill] for each stack of [skill]Short Summer[-skill]. Stacks gradually decay once [skill]Cold as Ice[-skill] ends, and all stacks are lost upon activating [skill]Cold as Ice[-skill] again.</code>
