						<category name="Winter's Veil">
							<hotfix name="Aurelia" package="Crocus_Baroness_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.WintersVeil SkillDescription After taking [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], or on [skill]Shield break[-skill], you emit a <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> [skill]Nova[-skill] that deals [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] with a high chance of <font color="#5ff5ff">freezing</font> enemies. Your Shield must [skill]fully recharge[-skill] between [skill][ice]Cryo[-ice] Novas[-skill].<br>Additionally, you deal increased [skill]Melee Damage[-skill].</code>
