							<hotfix name="Aurelia" package="Crocus_Baroness_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.Wintertide SkillDescription All of your non-<font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> Guns gain a <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> [skill]Bullet Damage Bonus Element[-skill] which can [ice]Freeze[-ice] enemies even if the original Gun could not apply [skill]Status Effects[-skill]. <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo</font> Guns instead deal increased <font color="#5ff5ff">Cryo Damage</font>.</code>
