								<code profiles="default">set Crocus_Baroness_Servant.Skills.Valet SkillDescription When your [vacuum]Servant[-vacuum] kills an enemy, you gain a stack of [skill]Valet[-skill]. You and your [vacuum]Servant[-vacuum] gain increased [skill]Reload Speed[-skill] and [skill]Swap Speed[-skill] for each stack of [skill]Valet[-skill]. All stacks of [skill]Valet[-skill] are lost upon termination of your [skill]Contract[-skill].</code>
								<code profiles="default">set Crocus_Baroness_Servant.Skills.Valet SkillEffectPresentations (AttributePresentationDefinition'Crocus_Baroness_Servant.Skills.Duchess:AttributePresentationDefinition_2',AttributePresentationDefinition'Crocus_Baroness_Servant.Skills.Valet:AttributePresentationDefinition_2',AttributePresentationDefinition'Crocus_Baroness_Servant.Skills.Valet:AttributePresentationDefinition_3')</code>
