							<hotfix name="Aurelia" package="Crocus_Baroness_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Crocus_Baroness_Servant.Skills.NextToCleanliness SkillDescription Improves your [skill]Gun Damage[-skill], [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], [skill]Shield Recharge Rate[-skill], and [skill]Shield Recharge Delay[-skill] for each [skill]Duchess[-skill] stack, but also reduces your [skill]Max Health[-skill] for each [skill]Duchess[-skill] stack.</code>
