						<category name="Take Their Freedom">
							<hotfix name="JackSkills" package="Quince_Doppel_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_Hero.Skills.TakeTheirFreedom SkillDescription Increases your [skill]Max Health[-skill]. Additionally, whenever you or your [skill]Digi-Jacks[-skill] kill an enemy, you and your [skill]Digi-Jacks[-skill] both restore a portion of [skill]Max Health[-skill].</code>
