						<category name="On My Mark ">
							<hotfix name="JackSkills" package="Quince_Doppel_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_Hero.Skills.OnMyMark SkillDescription Pressing <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> during [skill]Expendable Assets[-skill] causes your [skill]Digi-Jacks[-skill] to throw a copy of your [skill]grenade[-skill] at an enemy under your [skill]crosshairs[-skill]. You can only do this once each [skill]Expendable Assets[-skill] activation.<br>Additionally, your [skill]Digi-Jacks[-skill] gain increased [skill]Damage Dealt[-skill].</code>
