								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_Hero.Skills.PromotetheRanks SkillDescription Your first [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] spawned will be a [skill]Badass[-skill] that deals [skill]increased damage as [explosive]Explosive[-explosive][-skill], has 100% more [skill]Max Health[-skill], and periodically launches a powerful, homing [skill]Digi-Missile Barrage[-skill]. Each [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] spawned afterwards has a chance to be a [skill]Badass[-skill].<br>Additionally, you gain increased [skill]Max Health[-skill] and both you and your [skill]Digi-Jacks[-skill] gain increased [skill]Damage Dealt[-skill].</code>
