								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Teamwork SkillDescription If an ally enters [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill] or a [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] dies, you receive a stack of [skill]Teamwork[-skill], granting [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] for [corrosive]10[-corrosive] seconds. This effect can stack up to [corrosive]10[-corrosive] times, and stacks decay individually.</code>
