						<category name="Commitment ">
							<hotfix name="JackSkills" package="Quince_Doppel_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Commitment SkillDescription <font size="15">Whenever a [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] dies or an ally enters [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill], you gain a stack of [skill]Commitment[-skill], granting additional [skill]Fire Rate[-skill], [skill]Reload Speed[-skill], and [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill]. Stacks are also gained periodically as your allies remain in [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill].<br>Stacks granted when a [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] dies last for [corrosive]10[-corrosive] seconds, stacks gained from allies are quickly lost when they exit [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill], and there is no stack limit.</font></code>
