								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_FreeEnterprise.Skills.MoneyIsPower SkillDescription Dealing [skill]Bullet, Grenade, or Rocket Damage[-skill] or picking up money grants you a stack of [skill]Volatile Income[-skill], up to a max of [corrosive]999[-corrosive]. Each stack provides additional [skill]Damage Dealt[-skill], [skill]Reload Speed[-skill], [skill]Grenade Blast Radius[-skill], and [skill]Grenade Damage Resistance[-skill], and all stacks are immediately lost upon death or [skill]spending money[-skill].</code>
