							<hotfix name="JackSkills" package="Quince_Doppel_Streaming">
								<code profiles="default">set Quince_Doppel_FreeEnterprise.Skills.CompoundInterest SkillDescription Shooting an enemy with [skill]Bullets or Lasers[-skill] applies [skill]Compound Interest[-skill] to them, causing it to [skill]accrue interest[-skill] every [corrosive]2[-corrosive] seconds, up to a limit. Shooting the same enemy with a different gun consumes [skill]Compound Interest[-skill] and deals [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Grenade Damage[-skill] based on your skill rank and the amount of [skill]Interest accrued[-skill].<br>Additionally, gain increased [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill].</code>
