set GD_Shields.A_Item.Shield_Nova_Shock:AttributePresentationDefinition_1 Description <font size="14"><font color="#9f99ff">Maliwan Rebuke:</font> Releases a [skill]Nova[-skill] when depleted, dealing [shock]Shock[-shock] [skill]Status Effect Damage[-skill] in a radius.<br>[funstat][skill]Status Effects[-skill] caused by this Nova deal [corrosive]25%[-corrosive] of [skill]Nova Damage[-skill] per tick.</font>
