ll> to raise your [skill]Aspis[-skill] and absorb all direct frontal damage. The [skill]Aspis[-skill] can store a finite amount of absorbed damage as energy, indicated by the sound and visuals of the [skill]Aspis[-skill] ramping up, which exponentially increases its damage when thrown.<br>The [skill]Aspis[-skill] is automatically thrown at the end of the active duration, or if you press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> again while it is active, dealing [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Status Effect Damage[-skill] in a small radius before returning to you.","GD_Gladiator_Streaming,GD_Gladiator_Skills.SkillTree.Branch_Phalanx,Tiers,,((Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Vanguard',SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Invictus'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.UnitedFront',SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.ReturningFire'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.PrismaticAegis'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=1),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Stalwart',SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Clear',SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Ephodos'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.HoldTheLine',SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.PrepareForGlory'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=5),(Skills=(SkillDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.User'),PointsToUnlockNextTier=1))","GD_Gladiator_Streaming,GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Vanguard_Active,BaseRange,,2000.000000","GD_Gladiator_Streaming,GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Vanguard_Active:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_SpawnParticleSystem_4,DrawScale,,3.000000","GD_Gladiator_Streaming,GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Vanguard,SkillDescription,,Gain increased [skill]Max Health[-skill]. Additionally, while the [skill]Aspis[-skill] is active, you and allies within [corrosive]2000[-corrosive] units of you receive [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill]. This effect increases with damage absorbed by the [skill]Aspis[-skill], up to [useful]double[-useful] the base [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill].","GD_Gladiator_Streaming,GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Vanguard:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,bDisplayAsPercentage,,True","GD_Gladiator_Streaming,GD_Gladiator_Skills.Phalanx.Vanguard,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Misc.Att_Vanguard_HealthRegenTotal',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Misc.Att_Vanguard_HealthRegenPerLvl',InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Gladiator_Skills.Misc.Att_Vanguard_HealthRegenPerLvl',InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),(AttributeToModify=None,bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.00000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=0.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=0,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=.005000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),(AttributeToModify=ResourcePoolAttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.HealthResourcePool.HealthMaxValue_Player',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacter