tion_1,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.GameplayAttributes.PlayerCriticalHitBonus',","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.NoPainNoGain:AttributePresentationDefinition_9,Description,,Action Skill Cooldown Rate: $NUMBER$<br>Melee Override Cooldown Rate: $NUMBER$","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.NoPainNoGain:AttributePresentationDefinition_9,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.MeleeSkillCooldownResource.MeleeSkillCooldownConsumptionRate'","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.NoPainNoGain:AttributePresentationDefinition_9,bDontDisplayPlusSign,,False","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,Description,,Melee Override Cooldown Rate per Order Stack: $NUMBER$","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,Attribute,,ResourcePoolAttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.ShieldResourcePool.ShieldOnIdleRegenerationRate'","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,RoundingMode,,ATTRROUNDING_Float","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,FloatPrecision,,2","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,Description,,FFYL Duration per Order Stack: $NUMBER$","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Weapon.WeaponDamage'","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Discipline_Effect:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,RoundingMode,,ATTRROUNDING_Float",