inition_0.Behavior_Conditional_67,Conditions,,()","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.Pickpocket,SkillDescription,,Dealing [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] to an enemy restores a standard pickup's worth of ammo for non-[skill]Rocket Launcher[-skill] [skill]weapon types[-skill] to your reserves and [skill]fully refills your Magazine[-skill]. This effect can only activate once every [corrosive]1.5[-corrosive] seconds.</font>","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.Pickpocket_Feedback,InitialDuration,,1.5000000","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Misc.Att_Jurisdiction_FootSpeed:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0,ConstantValue,,0.0800","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Misc.Att_Jurisdiction_HealthRegen_PerLvl:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0,ConstantValue,,0.01000","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Jurisdiction,SkillDescription,,While [skill]Showdown[-skill] is active, you gain [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] and increased [skill]Movement Speed[-skill].","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Jurisdiction:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,Description,,Regenerates $NUMBER$ of your Max Health / sec.","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Order.Jurisdiction:AttributePresentationDefinition_5,Description,,Movement Speed: $NUMBER$","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.HellsCominWithMe,SkillDescription,,For [corrosive]6[-corrosive] seconds after [skill]reloading[-skill] or refilling your [skill]Magazine[-skill] via [skill]Pickpocket[-skill], your Guns gain a chance to [skill]burst-fire an additional shot[-skill] on trigger pull.","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.HellsCominWithMe,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.HellsCominWithMe:AttributePresentationDefinition_2',)","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.FanTheHammer.HellsCominWithMe,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((At