ValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),)","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.TheUnforgiven,SkillDescription,,[skill]Action Skill Augment[-skill]. While [skill]Showdown[-skill] is active, all shots that hit enemies [skill]ricochet towards other nearby enemies[-skill], dealing greatly reduced [skill]Gun Damage[-skill]. Additionally, [skill]Showdown[-skill] ending triggers [skill]Detonators[-skill] on all enemies who have been damaged by you during [skill]Showdown[-skill], dealing significant [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Grenade Damage[-skill] to them and anything nearby.","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.TheUnforgiven:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.BulletReflection.BulletReflectedOffEnemyDamageScale'","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.TheUnforgiven:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,bDisplayAsPercentage,,True","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.TheUnforgiven:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,bDontDisplayPlusSign,,True","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.TheUnforgiven:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,bDontDisplayNumber,,False","GD_Lawbringer_Streaming,GD_Lawbringer_Skills.Riflewoman.TheUnforgiven:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,bUseCustomNumberPlacement,,True",",GD_Prototype_Streaming.Anims1st.WeaponAnim_Melee,PlayRate,,1.66000000",",GD_Prototype_Streaming.Melee.BehaviorData_PlayerMeleeAttack,Damage,,(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Init_PlayerMeleeDamage',BaseValueScaleConstant=2.0000000)",",GD_Prototype_Streaming.Melee.BehaviorData_PlayerMeleeAttack,DamageTypeDefinition,,WillowDamageTypeDefinition'GD_Explosive.DamageType.DmgType_Explosive_Impact'",",GD_PlayerShared.Behaviors.BehaviorData_PlayerMeleeAttack,DamageTypeDefinition,,WillowDamageTypeDefinition'GD_Explosive.Dam