econds","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills_GBX.ActionSkill.Skill_VaultHunterEXE:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,Description,,Regenerates $NUMBER$ of your Max Health / sec while most Action Packages are active","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.Cooldown_QCS,BaseValue,,(BaseValueConstant=35.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills_GBX.ActionSkill.Skill_VaultHunterEXE,SkillDescription,,<font size=\"14\">[skill]Action Skill.[-skill] Press <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> to run your [skill]VaultHunter.EXE[-skill] program. It will analyze the situation, determine which \"Vault Hunter\" would do the best job, and then load an <font color=\"#ff6600\">ACTION PACKAGE</font> allowing you to fight in that manner for a duration. It also fully restores your [skill]Max Health[-skill] and grants [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill]; for [skill]Action Packages[-skill] that do not summon a [skill]Minion[-skill], you also receive [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill].<br>[useful]Warning:[-useful] [skill]VaultHunter.EXE[-skill] is currently classified as malware, and as such, your allies may be affected. </font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills_GBX.ActionSkill.Skill_VaultHunterEXE,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills_GBX.ActionSkill.Skill_VaultHunterEXE:AttributePresentationDefinition_2',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills_GBX.ActionSkill.Skill_VaultHunterEXE:AttributePresentationDefinition_3',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.PainSimulatorIsPainful:AttributePresentationDefinition_2')","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills_GBX.ActionSkill.Skill_VaultHunterEXE,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.ActiveSkillCooldownResource.ActiveSkillCooldownConsumptionRate',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnly