 Fiesta[-skill].","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.IAmRubberYouAreGlue:AttributePresentationDefinition_8,Description,,Deflection Chance: $NUMBER$<br>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.IAmRubberYouAreGlue:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,Description,,<font color=\"#ff6600\">Torgue Fiesta:</font> Party time! You and allies regenerate Grenades while you sporadically launch Grenades that hurt everything- including allies- around you.</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion,DamageEvents,,((EventType=SDE_DamagedEnemy,EventConstraints=((DamageTypeConstraint=None,DamageSourceConstraint=Class'WillowGame.WillowDmgSource_Bullet',bMustBeCriticalDamage=False,bMustBeOneShotKill=False),(DamageTypeConstraint=None,DamageSourceConstraint=Class'WillowGame.OzWillowDmgSource_Laser',bMustBeCriticalDamage=False,bMustBeOneShotKill=False),),EventName=\"DamagedEnemy\"))","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_30,DamageFormula,,(BaseValueConstant=1000.0,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=.30434782000000)","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_30,DamageSource,,Class'WillowGame.WillowDmgSource_Melee'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion:AttributePresentationDefinition_4,Description,,Combustion Chance: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_6,Description,,Combustion Damage: $NUMBER$ of body shot damage as Explosive Melee Damage","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_6,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageSourceModifiers.ReceivedBulletDamageModifier'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_6,bDontDisplayPlusSign,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_6,bDontDisplayMinusSign,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion,SkillDescription,,Whenever you damage an enemy with [skill]non-[explosive]Explosive[-explosive][-skill] [skill]Bullet Damage[-skill], you have a chance to cause a [explosive]Combustion[-explosive], which deals a portion of your [skill]equipped Gun's damage per projectile[-skill] as [explosive]Explosive Melee Damage[-explosive] in a [corrosive]100[-corrosive] unit radius.<br>For [skill]deflected Bullet or Lasers[-skill], the [explosive]Combustion[-explosive]'s damage is still based on your [skill]equipped Gun's body shot damage[-skill].","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_30,DamageRadiusFormula,,(BaseValueConstant=100.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion:AttributePresentationDefinition_4',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_6',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.DropTheHammer:AttributePresentationDefinition_0')","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.CoincidentalCombustion,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.Boomtrap.Att_CoincidentalCombustion_Chance',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.070000,BaseValueAttrib