the new owner of a rather large bomb. Hit enemies with the explosion or else...</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown,MaxGrade,,1","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.SecondWindByTediore:AttributePresentationDefinition_2',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown:AttributePresentationDefinition_3',)","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown,SkillName,,My Main Goal","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,bDontDisplayNumber,,False","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,bUseCustomNumberPlacement,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.SkillAttributes.RevivalHealthMultiplier'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown:BehaviorProviderDefinition_1.Behavior_ActivateSkill_517,SkillToActivate,,None","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown,SkillDescription,,You gain increased [skill]Fight For Your Life Duration[-skill] and now recover all of your [skill]Max Health[-skill] upon [skill]Second Wind[-skill].<br>Also, unlocks <font color=\"#ff6600\">ACTION PACKAGE</font> [skill]Clap-in-the-Box[-skill].","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.AllTheThingsAreAwesome,SkillDescription,,Increases [skill]Max Health[-skill], [skill]Reserve Ammo Capacity[-skill], and [skill]Swap Speed[-skill]. These bonuses are [skill]increased for[-skill] and [skill]shared with every ally in your party[-skill].<br><br>[useful]\"Everything is cool when you're part of a team!\"[-useful]","GD_Prototype_Str