ll:AttributePresentationDefinition_5,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell,SkillDescription,,<font size=\"15\">Gain increased [skill]Fire Rate[-skill], [skill]Reload Speed[-skill], passive [skill]Ammo Regeneration[-skill] for all types except [skill]Rocket Launchers[-skill], and increased [skill]Fight For Your Life Duration[-skill].</font>. While you are in [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill], the [skill]Fire Rate[-skill] and [skill]Reload Speed[-skill] are [skill]shared with allies[-skill] and [useful]doubled for you[-useful], and you gain greatly increased [skill]Movement Speed[-skill] in [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill].</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_5,Attribute,,ResourcePoolAttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.HealthResourcePool.HealthMaxValue_Player'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Boomtrap.DropTheHammer:AttributePresentationDefinition_1',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.DeathMachine:AttributePresentationDefinition_2',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_5',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_4',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_7',)","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.BlueShell:AttributePresentationDefinition_5,bDontDisplayMinusSign,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown_Active,SkillName,,On Defense About It","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown_Active,TrackedSkillType,,TRACKEDSKILL_Untracked","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.KickHimWhileHesDown_Active,bSubjectTo