hile [skill]VaultHunter.EXE[-skill] is active, these bonuses are [skill]shared with any allies[-skill] and you gain a further bonus to [skill]Grenade, Melee[-skill] and [skill]Status Effect Damage[-skill].","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.ThroughThickAndThin:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Description,,Action Skill Cooldown Rate: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.ElementOfSurprise:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,Description,,Damage Dealt: $NUMBER$<br>Additional Grenade, Melee, and Status Effect Damage: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.ElementOfSurprise:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,Attribute,,AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageSourceModifiers.InstigatedMeleeDamageModifier'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Description,,<font size=\"15\">Regenerates $NUMBER$ of your Max Health / sec.</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,RoundingMode,,ATTRROUNDING_Float","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,FloatPrecision,,1","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Description,,<font size=\"15\">Gun Damage: $NUMBER$<br>Fire Rate: $NUMBER$<br>Magazine Size: $NUMBER$</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,RoundingMode,,ATTRROUNDING_Float","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,FloatPrecision,,1","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys:AttributePresentationDefinition_6,Description,,<font size=\"15\">Duration/Cooldown: $NUMBER$ seconds</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys,SkillDescription,,<font size=\"15\">Gain passive [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] as well as increased [skill]Gun Damage[-skill], [skill]Fire Rate[-skill], and [skill]Magazine Size[-skill].<br>Hold <StringAliasMap:Action.Melee> to request a [skill]High Five[-skill] from friends and enemies alike; if you're left hanging for [corrosive]5[-corrosive] seconds, these bonuses are [useful]doubled[-useful] for [corrosive]20[-corrosive] seconds. If an enemy or ally [skill]Melees[-skill] your hand during that window, the bonuses are [useful]tripled[-useful] for [corrosive]20[-corrosive] seconds.<br>You cannot request another [skill]High Five[-skill] until either effect has expired.</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.ILoveYouGuys.Att_HighFiveGuys_WeaponDamage:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0,ConstantValue,,0.12500000","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.ILoveYouGuys.Att_HighFiveGuys_FireRate:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_3,ConstantValue,,-0.12500000","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.ILoveYouGuys.Att_HighFiveGuys_RegenAmount:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_2,ConstantValue,,0.0150000","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.HighFivesGuys_Active,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.GameplayAttributes.PawnFriendlyFireDamageAccepted',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,P