_Skills.Fragmented.SafetyFirst:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,Description,,Max Health: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.SafetyFirst,SkillDescription,,<font size=\"15\">[skill]Health Subroutine.[-skill] If you do not have any other [skill]Subroutines[-skill] available, automatically activate a [skill]Health[-skill] [skill]Subroutine[-skill], which grants increased [skill]Max Health[-skill] and passive [skill]Max Health Regeneration[-skill] at the cost of reducing your [skill]Gun Damage[-skill] with all types.<br>Upon selecting a [skill]Subroutine[-skill] you gain [corrosive]100[-corrosive] [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill], which decay over time. When [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill] hit [corrosive]0[-corrosive], your [skill]Subroutine[-skill] will be replaced with a new one, which will be a non-[skill]Health Subroutine[-skill] if you have any other [skill]Subroutines[-skill] available.</font>","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields,SkillName,,Subroutine - Health","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields,SkillIconTextureName,,Subroutine-Defensive-Health","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields,TrackedActiveSkills,,SkillDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields_Feedback'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Subroutines.Subroutine_Defensive_Shields,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=ResourcePoolAttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.HealthResourcePool.HealthMaxValue_Player',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Misc.Subroutines.Init_SubCheck_Capaci