eaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.GrenadeVent,SkillDescription,,Increases your [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill] and [skill]Grenade Damage Resistance[-skill]. Additionally, throwing a [skill]Grenade[-skill] adds [skill]Frag Stacks[-skill].<br><br>[useful]\"You should be throwing more grenades!\"[-useful]","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.GrenadeVent,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.GrenadeVent:AttributePresentationDefinition_0',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.BestBuds4Life:AttributePresentationDefinition_1',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.GrenadeVent:AttributePresentationDefinition_8')","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.GrenadeVent:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Description,,Grenade Damage: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.GrenadeVent:AttributePresentationDefinition_8,Description,,Frag Stacks on Grenade Throw: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.BestBuds4Life:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Description,,Grenade Damage Resistance: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.ILoveYouGuys.BestBuds4Life:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Attribute,,ResourcePoolAttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.AccuracyResourcePool.AccuracyOnIdleRegenerationRate'","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.ElementOfSurprise:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,Description,,Matching Element Damage: $NUMBER$","GD_Prototype_Streaming,GD_Prototype_Skills.Fragmented.ElementOfSurprise,SkillDescription,,[skill]Elemental Subroutines.[-skill] You randomly pick a [skill]Subroutine[-skill] that moderately increases [skill]Elemental Damage[-skill]... but only for one Element.<br>Additionally, on [skill]Shield break[-skill], [skill]Shield fill[-skill], or upon entering [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill], you release a [skill]Nova[-skill] of the chosen Elem