kills.HunterKiller.ColdWar,SkillDescription,,Gain increased [skill]Gun Status Effect Chance[-skill], with an additional bonus for [skill]Assault Rifles, SMGs, or Lasers[-skill].<br>Additionally, whenever you apply an [skill][incendiary]Incendiary[-incendiary][-skill], [skill][shock]Shock[-shock][-skill], or [skill][corrosive]Corrosive[-corrosive] Status Effect[-skill] to an enemy, there is a chance that a [skill]<font color=\"#5ff5ff\">Freeze</font> Effect[-skill] will be applied as well.","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar:AttributePresentationDefinition_0',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.ColdWar:AttributePresentationDefinition_1')","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder,SkillName,,Dogfight","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Description,,Wolf Bolt Damage per stack: $NUMBER$","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Description,,Stack Interval: 1 stack every $NUMBER$ seconds","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder,SkillDescription,,While [skill]Air Superiority[-skill] is active, you periodically gain stacks of [skill]Rolling Thunder[-skill], increasing [skill]Wolf's Bolt Damage[-skill]. Does not apply to [skill]Action Skill Augments[-skill] besides [skill]Venom Bolts[-skill].","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,FloatPrecision,,1","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,FloatPrecision,,1","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,bDisplayPercentAsFloat,,True","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.RollingThunder,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.Misc.Att_RollingThunder_StackDamage',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Pets,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.045000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.045000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),(AttributeToModify=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.DamageTypeModifers.InstigatedIceDamageModifier',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Pets,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=0.045000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.045000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),(AttributeToModify=None,bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=5.0000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,Initializatio