ge,,False","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.CyberCommando.VengeanceCannon,SkillDescription,,<font size=\"15\">[useful]Cyborg Augmentation:[-useful] Weapon<br>On [skill]Shield break[-skill], you automatically activate your shoulder-mounted [skill]Vengeance Cannon[-skill] and [skill]remove Gun Recoil[-skill] for a moderate duration. The [skill]Vengeance Cannon[-skill] receives most stat bonuses that apply to your Guns, and fires large, slow-moving projectiles that deal [skill][shock]Shock[-shock][-skill] [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill] in a [corrosive]400[-corrosive] unit radius in tandem with your equipped weapon. Your [skill]Shield[-skill] must [skill]fully recharge[-skill] between activations.<br><br>Additionally, your [skill]Shield Recharge Delay[-skill] is improved.</font>","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.CyberCommando.VengeanceCannon:AttributePresentationDefinition_2,Description,,Cannon Duration: $NUMBER$ seconds<br>","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.Weapon.WT_Vengeance_Cannon,InstantHitDamageType,,Class'WillowGame.WillowDmgSource_Grenade'","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.CyberCommando.VengeanceCannon,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=ResourcePoolAttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.ShieldResourcePool.ShieldOnIdleRegenerationDelay',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_Scale,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=-0.200000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),BonusUpgradeList=),(AttributeToModify=DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.Misc.Att_VengeanceCannonTime',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTa