cer_Streaming.Anims.Anim_Injured_Detonate:Behavior_CauseDamage_16,DamageFormula,,(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=AttributeInitializationDefinition'GD_Balance_HealthAndDamage.HealthAndDamage.Init_PlayerSkillDamage',BaseValueScaleConstant=20.000000)","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.Dreadnought.TerminationProtocols:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Description,,<br>\"I absolutely will not stop, ever, until you are dead.\"","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.Dreadnought.TerminationProtocols,SkillDescription,,Replaces [skill]Fight For Your Life[-skill] with [skill]Termination Protocols[-skill]. During [skill]Termination Protocols[-skill], you can walk at a reduced speed, fire your weapons, and you constantly [shock]Shock[-shock] nearby enemies. If the timer runs out, your power core goes critical, releasing a [skill]Nuclear Explosion[-skill] that deals massive [skill][explosive]Explosive[-explosive] Grenade Damage[-skill].<br>Additionally, you and [skill]Wolf[-skill] gain increased [skill]Damage Resistance[-skill] and [skill]Damage Dealt[-skill]","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.Dreadnought.TerminationProtocols,SkillEffectPresentations,,(AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.KillSwitch:AttributePresentationDefinition_1',AttributePresentationDefinition'GD_Enforcer_Skills.Dreadnought.TerminationProtocols:AttributePresentationDefinition_1')","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Streaming.Anims.Anim_Injured_Detonate:Behavior_CauseDamage_16,DamageTypeDefinition,,WillowDamageTypeDefinition'GD_Shock.DamageType.DmgType_Shock_Impact'","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.KillSwitch:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,bDontDisplayNumber,,False","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.KillSwitch:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Description,,Damage Dealt: $NUMBER$<br>Damage Resistance: $NUMBER$","GD_Enforcer_Streaming,GD_Enforcer_Skills.HunterKiller.KillSwit