ns to you, partially refunding your Cooldown.<br>Pressing <StringAliasMap:Action.ActionSkill> with an enemy under your crosshairs while your [skill]Shard[-skill] is active causes your [skill]Frost Shard[-skill] to jump to that enemy.","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ActionSkill.Misc.Cooldown_ColdAsIce,BaseValue,,(BaseValueConstant=30.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ActionSkill.Misc.Att_ColdAsIce_Duration:ConstantAttributeValueResolver_0,ConstantValue,,20.000000","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ActionSkill.Projectiles.Projectile_IceField:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_CauseDamage_36,DamageSource,,Class'WillowGame.WillowDmgSource_StatusEffect'","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ActionSkill.Projectiles.Projectile_IceField:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_CauseDamage_36,DamageFormula,,(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=AttributeDefinition'D_Attributes.Projectile.ProjectileDamage',InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=2.75000000)","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ActionSkill.Projectiles.Projectile_IceField:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Metronome_181,TickInterval,,0.40","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.Skill_ColdMoney_Enemy,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=DesignerAttributeDefinition'Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Misc.Att_ColdMoney_EnemySkillActive',bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_Self,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None