n,,2","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.WintersVeil,SkillDescription,,After taking [skill]Melee Damage[-skill], or on [skill]Shield break[-skill], you emit a <font color=\"#5ff5ff\">Cryo</font> [skill]Nova[-skill] that deals [skill]Melee Damage[-skill] with a high chance of <font color=\"#5ff5ff\">freezing</font> enemies. Your Shield must [skill]fully recharge[-skill] between [skill][ice]Cryo[-ice] Novas[-skill].<br>Additionally, you deal increased [skill]Melee Damage[-skill].","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.WintersVeil:AttributePresentationDefinition_3,Description,,Retaliatory Nova Damage: Rank $NUMBER$","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.WintersVeil:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_5,DamageFormula,,(BaseValueConstant=537.823792,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=18.50000000)","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.WintersVeil:BehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_5,DamageSource,,Class'WillowGame.WillowDmgSource_Melee'","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_Huntress.Skills.WarningShot:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Description,,Melee Damage: $NUMBER$","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_Huntress.Skills.WarningShot:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Attribute,,DesignerAttributeDefinition'GD_Shields.Misc.Att_ShieldNovaDamage_Explosive'","Crocus_Baroness_Streaming,Crocus_Baroness_ColdMoney.Skills.WintersVeil,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((AttributeToModify=None,bIncludeDuelingTargets=False,bIncludeSelfAsTarget=False,bOnlyEffectTargetsInRange=False,bExcludeNonPlayerCharacters=False,EffectTarget=TARGET_None,TargetInstanceDataName=,TargetCriteria=CRITERIA_None,ModifierType=MT_PreAdd,BaseModifierValue=(BaseValueConstant=1.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000),GradeToStartApplyingEffect=1,PerGradeUpgradeInterval=1,PerGradeUpgrade=(BaseValueConstant