el_Streaming,GD_Quince_JackClone.AI.AIDef_DigiJack_BaseAndBadass:AIBehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_2,DamageSource,,Class'WillowGame.WillowDmgSource_Grenade'","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Potential,SkillDescription,,When a [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] spawns, he sets off a [skill][shock]Shock[-shock] Nova[-skill], dealing [skill]Grenade Damage[-skill] in a radius.<br>Additionally, you can now [skill]Aim Down Sights in Fight For Your Life[-skill]!<br>No, we're totally not selling a basic feature back to you for one skill point. We would never!","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,GD_Quince_JackClone.AI.AIDef_DigiJack_BaseAndBadass:AIBehaviorProviderDefinition_0.Behavior_Explode_2,DamageFormula,,(BaseValueConstant=0.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=3.2500000)","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Delegation,SkillDescription,,While [skill]Expendable Assets[-skill] is active, a portion of damage taken from enemies is [skill]restored as Health[-skill], and then applied to your [skill]Digi-Jacks[-skill].","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Delegation:AttributePresentationDefinition_0,Description,,$NUMBER$ of Enemy Damage restored as Health","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Leadership,SkillDescription,,When a [skill]Digi-Jack[-skill] dies, it counts as if you had killed an enemy. This can grant you a [skill]Second Wind[-skill] once per [skill]Expendable Assets[-skill] activation.<br>However, your [skill]Action Skill Cooldown Rate[-skill] is decreased. That's the burden of leadership, buddy.","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Leadership:AttributePresentationDefinition_1,Description,,Action Skill Cooldown Rate: $NUMBER$<br><font color=\"#c66613\">\"If we all work together, I can achieve anything!\"</font>","Quince_Doppel_Streaming,Quince_Doppel_GreaterGood.Skills.Leadership,SkillEffectDefinitions,,((Attribu